(These reflections have dispelled the agitation with which I began my letter, and I feel) Tj
T*
(my heart glow with an enthusiasm which elevates me to heaven, for nothing contributes so) Tj
T*
(much to tranquillise the mind as a steady purpose--a point on which the soul may fix its) Tj
