T*
(nor even here in Archangel, among merchants and seamen. Yet some feelings, unallied to) Tj
T*
(the dross of human nature, beat even in these rugged bosoms. My lieutenant, for instance,) Tj
T*
(is a man of wonderful courage and enterprise; he is madly desirous of glory, or rather,) Tj
T*
(to word my phrase more characteristically, of advancement in his profession. He is an) Tj
T*
(Englishman, and in the midst of national and professional prejudices, unsoftened by) Tj
T*
(cultivation, retains some of the noblest endowments of humanity. I first became) Tj
T*
(acquainted with him on board a whale vessel; finding that he was unemployed in this city,) Tj
T*
(I easily engaged him to assist in my enterprise.) Tj
