15.500 TL
("Yet I cannot ask you to renounce your country and friends to fulfil this task; and now) Tj
T*
(that you are returning to England, you will have little chance of meeting with him. But) Tj
T*
(the consideration of these points, and the well balancing of what you may esteem your) Tj
T*
(duties, I leave to you; my judgment and ideas are already disturbed by the near approach) Tj
T*
(of death. I dare not ask you to do what I think right, for I may still be misled by) Tj
T*
(passion.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10.5 Tf
0.043 0.051 0.075 rg
1 0 0 1 64 421.39 Tm
15.500 TL
("That he should live to be an instrument of mischief disturbs me; in other respects, this) Tj
T*
(hour, when I momentarily expect my release, is the only happy one which I have enjoyed) Tj
T*
(for several years. The forms of the beloved dead flit before me, and I hasten to their) Tj
T*
(arms. Farewell, Walton! Seek happiness in tranquillity and avoid ambition, even if it be) Tj
T*
(only the apparently innocent one of distinguishing yourself in science and discoveries.) Tj
T*
(Yet why do I say this? I have myself been blasted in these hopes, yet another may) Tj
T*
(succeed.") Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10.5 Tf
0.043 0.051 0.075 rg
1 0 0 1 64 312.89 Tm
15.500 TL
(His voice became fainter as he spoke, and at length, exhausted by his effort, he sank) Tj
T*
(into silence. About half an hour afterwards he attempted again to speak but was unable;) Tj
T*
(he pressed my hand feebly, and his eyes closed for ever, while the irradiation of a) Tj
T*
(gentle smile passed away from his lips.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10.5 Tf
0.043 0.051 0.075 rg
1 0 0 1 64 250.89 Tm
15.500 TL
(Margaret, what comment can I make on the untimely extinction of this glorious spirit?) Tj
T*
(What can I say that will enable you to understand the depth of my sorrow? All that I) Tj
T*
(should express would be inadequate and feeble. My tears flow; my mind is overshadowed by) Tj
T*
(a cloud of disappointment. But I journey towards England, and I may there find) Tj
T*
(consolation.) Tj
