(I am interrupted. What do these sounds portend? It is midnight; the breeze blows fairly,) Tj
T*
(and the watch on deck scarcely stir. Again there is a sound as of a human voice, but) Tj
T*
(hoarser; it comes from the cabin where the remains of Frankenstein still lie. I must) Tj
T*
(arise and examine. Good night, my sister.) Tj
