(I entered the cabin where lay the remains of my ill-fated and admirable friend. Over him) Tj
T*
(hung a form which I cannot find words to describe--gigantic in stature, yet uncouth and) Tj
T*
(distorted in its proportions. As he hung over the coffin, his face was concealed by long) Tj
T*
(locks of ragged hair; but one vast hand was extended, in colour and apparent texture like) Tj
T*
(that of a mummy. When he heard the sound of my approach, he ceased to utter exclamations) Tj
T*
(of grief and horror and sprung towards the window. Never did I behold a vision so) Tj
T*
(horrible as his face, of such loathsome yet appalling hideousness. I shut my eyes) Tj
T*
(involuntarily and endeavoured to recollect what were my duties with regard to this) Tj
T*
(destroyer. I called on him to stay.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10.5 Tf
0.043 0.051 0.075 rg
1 0 0 1 64 622.89 Tm
15.500 TL
(He paused, looking on me with wonder, and again turning towards the lifeless form of his) Tj
T*
(creator, he seemed to forget my presence, and every feature and gesture seemed instigated) Tj
T*
(by the wildest rage of some uncontrollable passion.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10.5 Tf
0.043 0.051 0.075 rg
1 0 0 1 64 576.39 Tm
15.500 TL
("That is also my victim!" he exclaimed. "In his murder my crimes are consummated; the) Tj
T*
(miserable series of my being is wound to its close! Oh, Frankenstein! Generous and) Tj
T*
(self-devoted being! What does it avail that I now ask thee to pardon me? I, who) Tj
T*
(irretrievably destroyed thee by destroying all thou lovedst. Alas! He is cold, he cannot) Tj
T*
(answer me.") Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10.5 Tf
0.043 0.051 0.075 rg
1 0 0 1 64 498.89 Tm
15.500 TL
(His voice seemed suffocated, and my first impulses, which had suggested to me the duty of) Tj
T*
(obeying the dying request of my friend in destroying his enemy, were now suspended by a) Tj
T*
(mixture of curiosity and compassion. I approached this tremendous being; I dared not) Tj
T*
(again raise my eyes to his face, there was something so scaring and unearthly in his) Tj
T*
(ugliness. I attempted to speak, but the words died away on my lips. The monster continued) Tj
T*
(to utter wild and incoherent self-reproaches. At length I gathered resolution to address) Tj
T*
(him in a pause of the tempest of his passion.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10.5 Tf
0.043 0.051 0.075 rg
1 0 0 1 64 390.39 Tm
15.500 TL
("Your repentance," I said, "is now superfluous. If you had listened to the voice of) Tj
T*
(conscience and heeded the stings of remorse before you had urged your diabolical) Tj
T*
(vengeance to this extremity, Frankenstein would yet have lived.") Tj
